OL,3,GNEWSAParents fear for future over
OL,4,Aschool travel changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents of children with special
OL,7,Feducational needs say a council's
OL,8,Fproposal to change SEND travel
OL,9,Fprovision is a "kick in the teeth".
OL,11,FNottinghamshire County Council is
OL,12,Fconsulting on changes to its
OL,13,Fhome-to-school transport service for
OL,14,Fover 16s, in a bid to save money,
OL,15,Fsaying annual costs of about #29m are
OL,16,Fexpected to increase to #35m in the
OL,17,Fnext two years.
OL,19,FThe Reform UK-led authority could ask
OL,20,Ffamilies to pay a contribution towards
OL,21,Fthe service or in some cases it could
OL,22,Fbe stopped for some children.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
